%% UC-33 — Adaptive habit reminders (fading with habit strength)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (reminderPlanService)
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant OS as Device notifications

    P->>F: Create intention, pick reminder time (Cupertino wheel)
    F->>B: POST /habits/intentions {.., reminderTime: "19:30"}
    Note over F,B: On app start and after every SRHI submission:
    F->>B: GET /habits/intentions/reminder-plans
    B->>M: active intentions + srhi_responses + daily_behavior_logs + admin_settings (reminder_* weights)
    B->>B: autonomy = 0.5*SRHI + 0.35*adherence14d + 0.15*streak<br/>tier: daily -> every_2_days -> twice_weekly -> weekly -> off<br/>hysteresis: fading needs 2 supporting SRHI weeks<br/>recovery: adherence7d < 0.5 snaps back to daily
    B-->>F: {plans: [{intentionId, reminderTime, frequency, autonomyScore, components}]}
    F->>OS: cancelAll + zonedSchedule next 14 days per plan (local notifications)
    OS-->>P: Reminder fires at chosen time — less often as the habit strengthens
